COMPANY DEPARTMENTS AND RESPONSIBILITIES

The company has several departments that work together to support its daily operations.

IT DEPARTMENT

The IT department is responsible for software and technology-related activities.
Its main responsibilities include developing applications, maintaining backend systems,
supporting company systems, and solving technical problems.

The IT department includes developers and technical employees.
Employees in this department may work with programming, databases,
server-side systems, and application development.

HR DEPARTMENT

The HR department focuses on managing employees and supporting human resources activities.
Its responsibilities include recruitment, employee management, communication,
and maintaining employee-related information.

The HR team works with different departments when new employees are recruited
or when employee information needs to be updated.

FINANCE DEPARTMENT

The Finance department is responsible for accounting and financial activities.
Its work includes managing financial data, preparing financial information,
and supporting the company's financial operations.

The Finance department works with employee and company information
when financial records or salary-related data are required.